@Webhooks.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5165

### Create a new sample data object
Post {{Webhooks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sampledata
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Sample Data",
  "description": "This is a sample data object."
}

### Get all sample data objects 
Get {{Webhooks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sampledata 

### Create a new webhook subscription
POST {{Webhooks.Api_HostAddress}}/api/webhooks/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "eventType": "sampledata.created",
  "WebhookUrl": "https://webhook.site/d7dd6dc6-2069-4083-ba49-9a569ef539ee"
}